<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Brown &amp; Sharpe started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Brown &amp; Sharpe started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Barrington Research analyst Walter Liptak said he started coverage of Brown &amp; Sharpe Manufacturing Co with a 1-Buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the measurement devices maker were unchanged at Thursday's close of 13-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Liptak said a turnaround is underway at the company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
